flowchart TD
    Client[React Try Page]
    Gate[Live Generation Gate]
    Limiter[Generation Rate Limiter]
    Upload[Multer Upload Middleware]
    Controller[Generate Controller]
    Validator[Subtitle Validation Service]
    Parser[SRT / VTT Parser Service]
    Chunker[Chunking Service]
    AI[Gemini AI Service]
    Errors[Global Error Handler]
    Gemini[Google Gemini API]

    Client -->|File field: file| Gate
    Gate --> Limiter
    Limiter --> Upload
    Upload --> Controller
    Controller --> Validator
    Validator --> Parser
    Parser --> Chunker
    Chunker --> AI
    AI --> Gemini
    Gemini --> AI
    AI -->|Markdown| Controller
    Controller -->|JSON response| Client

    Gate -. failures .-> Errors
    Limiter -. failures .-> Errors
    Upload -. failures .-> Errors
    Controller -. failures .-> Errors
